Asset provenance
----------------
tools/extract_sprites.py describes the source action boards as AI-generated
key-pose images. The tool crops, removes backgrounds, aligns and quantizes
sprites from external reference packs. The S05 crystal-ruins scene is generated
procedurally by tools/make_s05.py. The docs/media demonstrations depict the
project's rendered game.

The external reference packs and generation records are not included in this
repository. Complete provenance, including whether official or third-party
images were supplied as generation inputs, cannot be verified from this
repository alone. AI generation is not, by itself, proof of permission or
compliance with the guidelines.

